        "original_id": "45ee0ff4-0acf-5eda-a12e-a5857b4d1b92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Andrew G. Vajna, Mario Kassar\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures, C2 Pictures, Carolco Pictures\n- Topics: film careers, company closures\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Oldman was born on 21 March 1958 and is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a series of box office bombs, including The Scarlet Letter, and the company closed in 1998.\n- In 2002, Carolco Pictures co-founders Andrew G. Vajna and Mario Kassar started the film company C2 Pictures.\n- Andrew G. Vajna had formed Cinergi Pictures before that company folded in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
